Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|osgi.app.includes|google-maps|
		|plugins.deployment.type|osgi|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Google|
		|testray.main.component.name|Google|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG
	When Page add
		|pageName|Test Page|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG
Scenario: Google Maps Portlet Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|appName|Google Maps|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Google Maps|